{"id":"n16731-1-7","stage":3,"title":"살아나다 · 复活","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16731-1-7-1","ko":"아버지께서 사고로 의식이 없으시다가 극적으로 살아났어요.","zh":"父亲因事故失去意识，后来奇迹般地活了过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지께서","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지께서","audio":"/audio/e826a68a64d3d7144cf6.mp3"}},{"text":"사고로","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사고로","audio":"/audio/dceda906e61ec19c9c33.mp3"}},{"text":"의식이","meaning":"意识","explanation":"의식：意识；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"의식","audio":"/audio/2a45b0dd02cce2315c70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24080","senseId":"1","lemma":"의식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의식이","audio":"/audio/79a4b1263790f6e3a248.mp3"}},{"text":"없으시다가","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없으시다가","audio":"/audio/b91a07964ed9228c41e1.mp3"}},{"text":"극적으로","meaning":"神奇的","explanation":"극적：神奇的；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"극적","audio":"/audio/72d1b11e621ca4dfe915.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32568","senseId":"2","lemma":"극적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"극적으로","audio":"/audio/b5d45790655e117fc238.mp3"}},{"text":"살아났어요.","meaning":"复活，复生","explanation":"살아나다：复活，复生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"살아나다","audio":